# Cloudflare Workers Static Assets redirect rules.
# https://developers.cloudflare.com/workers/static-assets/redirects/
#
# The section was renamed newspaper -> magazine. These 301s keep every
# URL that was ever indexed, linked from a newsletter, or saved as a
# download working. They are permanent on purpose: a 302 leaves the old
# path in Google's index and keeps splitting link equity between two
# URLs for the same issue.
#
# IMPORTANT: same constraint as `_headers` — CF Workers Static Assets
# allows only ONE `*` splat per pattern and silently drops a rule that
# breaks it. `:lang` is a placeholder (matches one path segment), which
# does NOT count against that budget. `src/features/magazine/helpers/
# redirectRules.test.ts` fails the build if a rule regresses.

# Listing, per-locale RSS feed, and issue pages.
/:lang/newspaper.xml  /:lang/magazine.xml     301
/:lang/newspaper      /:lang/magazine         301
/:lang/newspaper/*    /:lang/magazine/:splat  301

# Issue downloads (PDF/FB2) live outside the locale prefix — the old
# links are what the published issues' download buttons pointed at.
/newspaper/*          /magazine/:splat        301
